    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d755-a1">

                <pb facs="0926" n="844" xml:id="pg844"/>

                <head>[Translation.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">“Laybach</hi>, (near Trieste,) <hi
                            rendition="#italic">May</hi> 5.</placeName></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">“The Mexican free corps</hi>.—The recruiting for the
                    Mexican free corps will definitely be closed to-day. All the recruits have to be
                    ready on the 8th of this month at the principal depot at Laybach, as the
                    embarcation commences in Trieste on the 10th instant. The Mexican Colonel
                    Leisser will personally attend to the embarcation.”</p>
                <p>What the Austrian government will decide now, after your protest, will soon he
                    seen, as the embarcation was to take place on the 10th of this month.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, very respectfully, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>T. CANISIUS, <hi rendition="#italic">United States
                    Consul</hi>.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
